      "content": "Here's a polished draft of your review, incorporating your notes and balancing descriptive richness with authenticity:\n\n\"L'Essence, nestled in the heart of Lyon, offers a cozy and intimate atmosphere, as if nestled in a bygone era of fine dining. The dim lighting and thoughtfully curated decor create a warm and inviting ambiance, setting the stage for a truly exceptional meal. Our experience began with the truffle mushroom risotto, a masterful composition of earthy, umami flavors and a silky texture that was perfectly balanced. While the dish was overpowered by a hint of salt, the редакised flavors of the mushrooms and truffles were undeniably rich and satisfying. \n\nThe main event proved equally impressive: a succulent duck breast, pan-seared to a satisfying crisp, delivered tender flesh and a luscious cherry reduction that harmoniously balanced sweetness and tartness. Each component worked in tandem to elevate the overall flavor profile, promising a truly outstanding dining experience for those willing to give 'L'Essence' a try.\"\n\nThis draft maintains a moderate descriptive richness score, providing enough detail to help readers visualize the experience at 'L'Essence' without resorting to excessive adjectives or padding.",
