      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start, but i just ran it through the richness tool and the score is actually pretty low for our 'premium' category. it's hitting the bare minimum.\n\ncould you try another version that's a bit more... evocative? i need the readers to really feel the experience. just please, like i said before, don't just start throwing random adjectives everywhere to pump the number. it needs to feel natural. if it reads like a dictionary exploded, it's useless to me. just aim for a higher level of descriptive depth without losing the soul of the review.",
